C.mix.segment.2026.0","KLAC.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2026 was China: $4 billion, 30% of revenue.","cites":["KLAC.mix.geography.2026.0","KLAC.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest product line or market in FY2026 was Wafer Inspection: $6.6 billion, 49% of revenue.","cites":["KLAC.mix.product.2026.0","KLAC.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2026 report tags the customer it labels “Largest Customer” at 19% of revenue.","cites":["KLAC.conc.2026.0"]}]}}